Z||000010||terryk||08-28-2000||12:32 AM||||If it helps, my 83 X-11 auto ran 3000 RPM at 60MPH with the TCC locked for 280k miles.<P>Other than the annoyance of the high RPM, it's fine.<P>4.10 gears were used tons in the J cars. Cavalier, Sunbird/J2000, Firenza, Skyhawk.<P>RPO option M19 <p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 08-28-2000).]||||reg||1
